      "content": "Egnyte Public API provides programmatic access to files, folders, users, groups, permissions, links, and audit reports in an Egnyte tenant. Authentication is via OAuth 2.0 scoped access tokens. All endpoints live under the customer tenant domain.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Egnyte Developers",
